<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Normandy half year net A$51.6 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Normandy half year net A$51.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		 79.7  vs 96.3</p>
<p>    Net profit			 51.6  vs 20.2</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		 2.5  vs 2.5</p>
<p>NOTE: Normandy Mining Ltd is a diversified miner which last year merged with associates Posgold Ltd and Gold Mines of Kalgoorlie  and made a bid for North Flinders Mines Ltd, of which it now owns 75 percent.  </p>
<p>    Sales			    611.6  vs 608.5</p>
<p>    Other income		    54.4  vs 27.8</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			3.3  vs  3.8</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		   nil  vs  nil</p>
<p>Dividend is 50 percent franked</p>
<p>Pay date March 18</p>
<p>Reg date March 3</p>
<p>    Tax				 20.9  vs  37.6</p>
<p>    Interest			   9.3  vs  12.3</p>
<p>    Depreciation		    74.9  vs  77.5</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
